# A phone held landscape (844 x 390 at DPR 3): the status drawer, Journey
# stage 1 from Play steered off the board by the touch pad (eliminated), the
# results, then Next (stage 2) and Leave round from the pause screen.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Territory Trail
frames 60
touch =Open status panel
until 300 =Close
frames 10
save tt-land-drawer
touch =Close
frames 10
touch =Play
until 300 Claim 60 cells
frames 220
save tt-land-play
touch =Move up
until 1200 =Eliminated
frames 30
save tt-land-results
touch =Next
until 300 Wide Loop
frames 220
touch =Pause game
until 300 =Paused
frames 10
touch =Leave round
until 300 New here?
